      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2 id=\"plugin-description\"><a href=\"#plugin-description\"><strong>Plugin Description</strong></a></h2>\n<p>The UAS Tool is a plug-in that provides integration of Unmanned Aircraft Systems (UAS) for enhanced Situational Awareness (SA) and telemetry data, Full Motion Video (FMV), and command and control (C2).</p>\n<h2 id=\"instruction-videos\"><a href=\"#instruction-videos\">Instruction Videos</a></h2>\n<h4 id=\"tak-syndicate-uastool-youtube-playlist\"><a href=\"#tak-syndicate-uastool-youtube-playlist\">TAK Syndicate Uastool youtube playlist</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL0RLIF82BUhmc7ovS2VF1nKJf7_14S0Wv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL0RLIF82BUhmc7ovS2VF1nKJf7_14S0Wv</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"how-to-install-atak-and-the-uas-plugin-in-the-dji-mavic-3t\"><a href=\"#how-to-install-atak-and-the-uas-plugin-in-the-dji-mavic-3t\">How to INSTALL ATAK and the UAS PLUGIN in the DJI Mavic 3T</a></h4>"
